+/// Whether Minecraft appearing as `pid` starts the overlay swap over: only a process we haven't
+/// seen, whose link starts its writer at slot 1 (resetting for the same one would leave both sides
+/// on one slot).
+fn overlay_restarts(last_pid: u32, pid: u32) -> bool {
+    pid != 0 && pid != last_pid
